    "MC-14 (2026-10-27) removed: application_bound_materials imports application_worker_browser._unresolved_write_failure (now the public application_worker.unresolved_write_failure); with it the bound_materials <-> worker_browser mutual pair resolved.",
    "MC-14 moved: career_portal imports application_pdf_reuse._acceptance -> application_runtime (measurement observer wiring moved with Runtime assembly; Flow does not import pdf_reuse because pdf_reuse already imports Flow).",
    "MC-19 (2026-10-28) removed: application_bound_materials <-> application_flow mutual pair (the unused stage/editable/prepare compatibility wrappers were deleted; bound_materials no longer imports Flow).",
    "MC-19 (2026-10-28) removed: application_existing_materials imports application_experience_latex._load (read_completed and its lineage check moved to their owner application_experience_latex).",
    "MC-19 (2026-10-28) added private_attribute_uses: per-file counts, across src and tests/, of receiver._name attribute uses for flow, self.flow, pipeline, store, ApplicationFlowService and ApplicationResumeStore. Increases fail; decreases must be recorded here. Split-out Flow/Resume files (existing_materials, existing_handoff, match_refresh, match_recheck, material_batch; group_review, experience_latex, experience_content, writing, full_latex) are Module-internal per the 2026-10-28 MC-19 decision; flow._save replays and pipeline._tick remain deferred.",
    "MC-19 review P2-2 (2026-10-28) decreased private_attribute_uses: tests/test_flow_match_execution_admission.py 12 -> 0 (entry removed) and tests/test_p06_flow_edit.py 18 -> 14; read-only assertion and baseline reads now use flow.witness, task_snapshot and snapshot()[\"tasks\"]. Worker-interface and installed-readiness reads used receivers the count does not track, so their counts are unchanged.",
    "Batch 1-A (2026-11-02) removed: application_flow <-> application_resume, application_flow <-> application_explanations, application_flow <-> application_match_refresh and application_flow <-> application_match_recheck mutual pairs. job_input_revision, analysis_input_binding, retained_configuration_inputs and latest_preparation_task moved to application_input_binding (imports only validation.hashing); qualification_status and task_eligibility moved to application_eligibility. application_flow keeps re-exports for existing callers.",
    "2026-11-02 flow-closure batch 1/2 merge: removed private import application_single_binding -> application_experience_latex._fixed_inputs_revision (input binding Module owns the revision rule); tests/test_worker_operation_scope.py private uses 3 -> 0 (takeover record Module); tests/test_pipeline_queue_assertions.py recorded at 8 (batch 1-D read-only assertions live inside Pipeline._stop/_save and have no public entry until C4 lands); tests/test_automatic_material_reuse_edit.py 6 -> 10 recorded as pre-existing drift from b5da8b57 (2026-11-01), which changed the test without updating this baseline.",
    "2026-11-02 flow-closure merge: removed the application_recommendations <-> job_listing_links mutual import introduced by a900d2aa (2026-10-31) without a baseline update; recommendation_key moved to application_automation beside application_key and is re-exported by application_recommendations."
